WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Block primary volumes before adding lamps, vents or trim. Large forms establish the composition and constrain later detail.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Build the body from cabin, front volume, rear volume and wheel/tire circles; only then add a small opening.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Shape construction

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

